# World of Warcraft Places A-Z (Vanilla Only)

**A** - Azeroth
**B** - Booty Bay
**C** - Crossroads
**D** - Darnassus
**E** - Elwynn Forest
**F** - Feralas
**G** - Gnomeregan
**H** - Hillsbrad Foothills
**I** - Ironforge
**J** - Jintha'Alor
**K** - Kalimdor
**L** - Loch Modan
**M** - Mulgore
**N** - Naxxramas
**O** - Orgrimmar
**P** - Plaguelands (Eastern/Western)
**Q** - Quel'Thalas
**R** - Razorfen Downs
**S** - Stormwind
**T** - Tanaris
**U** - Undercity
**V** - Vale of Shadows
**W** - Wetlands
**X** - X-... hmm, this one's tricky!

Let me think about X, Y, and Z:

**X** - There really isn't a vanilla location starting with X. The closest might be **Xoroth**, but that's a demon world mentioned in lore (warlock mount quest), not a place you visit. I'll count it as lore!

**Y** - **Yojamba Isle** (the Zandalar island in Stranglethorn Vale)

**Z** - Zul'Gurub

---

*Note: X was genuinely difficult — vanilla WoW has almost nothing starting with that letter. Xoroth is a stretch since it's only referenced in the Dreadsteed questline, but it IS part of vanilla lore!* [end of text]


